 "how_the_files_of_record_were_treated": [
  "the rows of the membership file, the attribution files and the licence table travel whole; the keys that carry clock stamps or internal names (_stamp, _owner, inputs) are dropped and the files are pinned here by sha256",
  "the certificates carry a curated field list (identity, set, status, keep flag, audit label, band aim, conversion method and reference origin, a curated provenance block) and no run outcomes",
  "a clock stamp is written as a day",
  "a value that fails the publication check's data vocabulary (a name, a stamp, an internal word) is withheld, never rewritten; the counts per field are under withheld",
  "a task whose upstream terms permit pointers only, or whose text fails the publication check, ships as a pointer with the reason",
  "io_mode, plus_inputs_removed and input_shapes are task facts the judge applies, written onto the records from their files of record"
 ],
